        <p>
          🧠
          <span data-lang="pt"
            ><b>Cram de 30 min:</b> leia os conceitos, depois abra cada pergunta
            e responda <em>antes</em> de revelar. Para Next.js, grave a
            fronteira Server/Client e a regra do <code>children</code>.</span
          ><span data-lang="en"
            ><b>30-min cram:</b> read the concepts, then open each question and
            answer it <em>before</em> revealing. For Next.js, lock the
            Server/Client boundary and the <code>children</code> rule.</span
          >
        </p>
